{"unit_id":"Yelloooooow__dsh-shutdown-button#card-zh","repo":"Yelloooooow/dsh-shutdown-button","commit":"8bb911c7a9fde2343df334015612067cdea41df5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-shutdown-button 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的关机插件。它在侧栏脚部加入电源按钮，并在 shell 覆盖层显示确认弹窗；确认后浏览器向 Host 端发送 POST 请求，由服务端调用 DSH 提供的 appExit 优雅结束进程。用户可以取消操作，也能在请求失败时恢复界面。适合需要从 Web 界面主动结束 DSH 进程的场景。无需额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/client.js:97-165","plugin/index.js:25-48"]}
{"unit_id":"Yelloooooow__dsh-shutdown-button#card-en","repo":"Yelloooooow/dsh-shutdown-button","commit":"8bb911c7a9fde2343df334015612067cdea41df5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-shutdown-button adds a power button to the DSH Web sidebar. Clicking it opens a confirmation dialog; confirming sends a POST request to the Host route, which calls DSH's appExit function to end the process. Users can cancel beforehand. It needs no extra configuration or external services.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/client.js:97-165","plugin/index.js:25-48"]}
